{"id":"erleichterung","lemma":"Erleichterung","pos":"noun","rank":4850,"glosses":["relief","ease, easing","alleviation"],"ipa":"/ɛɐ̯ˈlaɪ̯çtəʁʊŋ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/81/De-Erleichterung.ogg/De-Erleichterung.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Erleichterung","plural":"Erleichterungen"},"examples":[{"text":"Das ist eine Erleichterung.","en":"It's a relief.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/195631","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Was für eine Erleichterung!","en":"What a relief!","words":[null,null,{"g":"a"},null],"phrases":[[0,2,"what"]]},{"text":"Seine Mutter seufzte vor Erleichterung.","en":"His mother sighed with relief.","words":[{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},{"g":"mother"},{"g":"to sigh","l":"seufzen"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},null]},{"text":"Diese Medizin wird dir etwas Erleichterung verschaffen.","en":"This medicine will give you some relief.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"medicine (the study of…"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"something"},null,{"g":"to provide"}]},{"text":"Sie gab ein Seufzen der Erleichterung von sich.","en":"She gave out a sigh of relief.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"to sigh"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"oneself"}]}]}